"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間がある時に少しずつ読んでます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからぜひやってみたいことはなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、真逆にこれだけは絶対無理！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というのはありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技とか、逃走中とか、旅とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やりたいことたくさんあり過ぎる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0033.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズとかはあかんやろね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0034.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖いのとかもあかん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋に飾ってあるスマイルマークは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本で買ったの？アメリカのお土産?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニコちゃんの雑貨は全部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかあちゃんが集めてたもの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の部屋、いろんなところに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニコちゃんいるよーにこにこっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前の乃木どこ見て思ったんだけど、フレンチブルにカプッとやられた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気にのブーツ、やっぱ穴あいちゃったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"穴が空いてたら泣いて立ち直れてない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0037.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0037.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に手にリボン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つけてくから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっててくれる？♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りょーかいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0038.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりりんて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔関西のどこに住んでたの～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0039.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかって、、筋トレとかできるの⁇ｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"運動好きやけど、筋トレはできんかなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0040.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん、スノボ出来る？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できないー‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特技、スノボ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかめっちゃかっこいいやーーーーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0043.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキーは修学旅行とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっさい頃にやったことあるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どや))←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0044.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真洋があそぼーていうから遊んだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/1339542/0045.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は真洋をムービーで撮りすぎた。"}